<section class="editorial-statement section-space" aria-labelledby="mission-title">
  <div class="site-shell statement-grid">
    <p class="section-label section-label-dark reveal"><span>01</span> Our mission</p>
    <h2 id="mission-title" class="statement-title reveal">Make the path between potential and opportunity feel <em>clearer, more human, and less overwhelming.</em></h2>
    <p class="statement-copy reveal">We believe useful career support begins by listening. Advice should reflect a person’s real experience, target role, constraints, and ambitions—not force everyone through the same template.</p>
