<section class="approach-section section-space" aria-labelledby="approach-title">
  <div class="site-shell">
    <p class="section-label reveal"><span>02</span> How we work</p>
    <div class="section-heading-grid">
      <h2 id="approach-title" class="section-display reveal">A considered approach to every next move.</h2>
      <p class="section-aside reveal">The tools may change. The standard stays the same: accurate information, thoughtful judgment, and clear communication.</p>
    </div>

    <ol class="principle-list">
      <li class="principle-row reveal">
        <span>01</span>
        <h3>Listen before recommending.</h3>
        <p>We begin with context—where you are, what you want, and what is making progress difficult.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="principle-row reveal">
        <span>02</span>
        <h3>Make the work specific.</h3>
        <p>Résumés, searches, and interview preparation should reflect the role and the person, not generic advice.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="principle-row reveal">
        <span>03</span>
        <h3>Keep decisions visible.</h3>
        <p>Candidate-authorized applications and transparent communication keep people informed and in control.</p>
      </li>
      <li class="principle-row reveal">
        <span>04</span>
        <h3>Be honest about outcomes.</h3>
        <p>We improve preparation and reduce busywork. We do not promise a job, interview, salary, or timeline.</p>
      </li>
    </ol>
  </div>
</section>

